                  icon: "/assets/images/units/abilities/board_augment_256.webp",
                  title: "Placement",
                  text: `The free option gives a partial ${placementDepths[0]}-row zone and up to 6 stacks. Spending 1 point gives a full ${placementDepths[1]}-row zone and 7 stacks. The second paid option costs 2 points and opens ${placementDepths[2]} full rows including the board edge, plus the baseline cap of 8 stacks before Nature bonuses.`,
              },
              {
                  icon: "/assets/images/units/abilities/armor_augment_256.webp",
                  title: "Armor",
                  text: "+6%, +13%, or +21% team armor, plus the same number of points added straight onto magic armor. Strong when your army needs to survive first contact.",
              },
              {
                  icon: "/assets/images/units/abilities/might_augment_256.webp",
                  title: "Might",
                  text: "+8%, +17%, or +27% melee attack. This is for armies that intend to fight up close.",
              },
              {
                  icon: "/assets/images/units/abilities/empower_augment_256.webp",
                  title: "Empower",
                  text: "+7%, +15%, or +24% magic damage: offensive spells, Fire Wall, Fireforged Sword, Chain Lightning, Fire Breath and Fire Shield. For armies that win with spells rather than steel.",
              },
              {
                  icon: "/assets/images/units/abilities/sniper_augment_256.webp",
                  title: "Sniper",
